\description{
Differentially private counterpart of
\code{\link[=flow_matching_trainer]{flow_matching_trainer()}}. The objective is unchanged: each record draws
its own noise point \eqn{x_0}, its own time \eqn{t}, and contributes its
own squared error against the conditional velocity. Because the batch loss
